Original commit body from 0d75a10:

When using --progress flag, sketch now displays item-level progress
during embedding computation: "Embedding files: 10/157"

This provides visibility into the heaviest lift (embedding) and
helps users understand progress during large repo analysis.

Also increased default semantic_top_n from 3 to 10 for Additional
Files section, surfacing more semantically relevant documentation.

Changes:
- Add update_item_progress() to SketchProgress for item-level progress
- Add progress_callback parameter to _format_additional_files()
- Change semantic_top_n default from 3 to 10
